OL,3,GNEWSASecond cross-Channel ferry route
OL,4,Aends early
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cross-Channel ferry route is to be
OL,7,Fshut down earlier than planned
OL,8,Ffollowing a technical problem with a
OL,9,Fship.
OL,11,FThe last sailing of Brittany Ferries'
OL,12,FBarfleur vessel between Poole and
OL,13,FCherbourg was scheduled for 2 November
OL,14,Fbut the operator has said the ship
OL,15,Fwould now be moved to its route between
OL,16,FCherbourg and Rosslare on 12 October.
OL,18,FIt said the route between France and
OL,19,Fthe Republic of Ireland was
OL,20,F"strategically significant"
OL,21,Fpost-Brexit.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
